abstract: >-
  An independent open evaluation framework for spatial views, geometry,
  persistence, appearance editing and dynamics. The executable release
  provides offline diagnostics, analytic calibration worlds, portable
  evidence bundles, paired world-level uncertainty and metric replay.
keywords:
